  "goodToKnow": "Der Schatzmeister (die Schatzmeisterin) is a treasurer of a party, foundation or club. In smaller Vereine, people often say der Kassenwart. Club boards typically include a Vorsitzender (chair), Schatzmeister and Schriftführer (secretary). Der Schatz means treasure, and also darling: Mein Schatz! The plural is the same: die Schatzmeister."
